      "dc:source": "c2020a00094.pdf, p.7",
      "values:originalText": "Add:\n\n; or (c) the goods underwent in that country one or more processes\nprescribed by the regulations.\n\n[Minister’s second reading speech made in—\nSenate on 17 June 2020\nHouse of Representatives on 27 October 2020]\n\n(85/20)",
      "skos:definition": "Add:\n\n; or (c) the goods underwent in that country one or more processes\nprescribed by the regulations.\n\n[Minister’s second reading speech made in—\nSenate on 17 June 2020\nHouse of Representatives on 27 October 2020]\n\n(85/20)",
      "cml:asserts": [
